{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064569/block/singleImage/3271652/df/01M7RSFFQXBQWFCMF1WWFB7Z39.jpeg?updatedAt=1795054672\"/><figcaption>警聯入境處灣仔銅鑼灣掃黃拘11內地女，年齡介乎19至50歲。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>灣仔警區特別職務隊聯同相關部門，根據線報及深入調查後，昨日 (18 日 ) 下午在區內展開掃黃行動，突擊搜查皇后大道東、灣仔道、駱克道及蘭芳道多個樓上單位。 行動中，人員共拘捕 11 名年齡介乎 19 歲至 50 歲的內地女子，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.974470+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:04.460776+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:24.522505+00:00","content_hash":"237c0402736cb22e58e990fa5435ce34bd851d88794983a18f7cff103445774e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.974470+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}